      "end": 1295,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 8,
      "text": "3. Perused the grounds for grant of bail stated in the application, case diary and the relevant material on record.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 1297,
      "end": 1412,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 9,
      "text": "NEUTRAL CITATION NO. 2026:MPHC-IND:3483 2 MCRC-58817-2025 4.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 1413,
      "end": 1474,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "NEUTRAL CITATION NO. 2026",
          "label": "CASE_NUMBER",
          "start": 1414,
          "end": 1439
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 10,
      "text": "Learned counsel for the applicant, in addition to the grounds mentioned in the application,\nsubmits that the applicant has been falsely implicated in this matter.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 1475,
      "end": 1637,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.25021088123321533
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 11,
      "text": "The whole family has been falsely implicated in this offence by the victim.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 1638,
      "end": 1713,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.46169909834861755
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 12,
      "text": "No offence, as alleged, is committed by the applicant.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 1714,
      "end": 1768,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.4569370746612549
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 13,
      "text": "The FSL report does not substantiate the accusation.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 1770,
      "end": 1822,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "FSL",
          "label": "ORG",
          "start": 1774,
          "end": 1777
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.40726158022880554
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 14,
      "text": "The victim did not make any complaint against Dinesh vs The State Of Madhya Pradesh on 3 February, 2026 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/52952941/\n1 the applicant for six years.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 1823,
      "end": 2011,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Dinesh vs The State Of Madhya Pradesh",
          "label": "PRECEDENT",
          "start": 1869,
          "end": 1906
        },
        {
          "text": "3 February, 2026",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 1910,
          "end": 1926
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.4675692617893219
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 15,
      "text": "The applicant has already undergone the custody for almost one year and eight months.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 2012,
      "end": 2097,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.3488818109035492
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 16,
      "text": "Only 01 prosecution witness out of 42 cited witnesses have been examined.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2098,
      "end": 2171,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.24124714732170105
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 17,
      "text": "The trial would take time to conclude.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_RESPONDENT",
      "start": 2172,
      "end": 2210,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.30478551983833313
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 18,
      "text": "The applicant be extended benefit of bail.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_RESPONDENT",
      "start": 2211,
      "end": 2253,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.3151741623878479
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 19,
      "text": "5. Per contra, learned counsel for the respondent/State opposes the bail application on the ground of gravity of alleged offence.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_RESPONDENT",
      "start": 2255,
      "end": 2384,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.23837535083293915
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 20,
      "text": "The video have been recovered from the PAN Drive.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_RESPONDENT",
      "start": 2385,
      "end": 2434,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.24486781656742096
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 21,
      "text": "The complicity of the applicant in the alleged offence has been clearly made out from material on record.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_RESPONDENT",
      "start": 2435,
      "end": 2540,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.26027196645736694
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 22,
      "text": "The bail application is meritless.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_RESPONDENT",
      "start": 2541,
      "end": 2575,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2614436149597168
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 23,
      "text": "6. Heard the arguments, perused the grounds for grant of bail stated in the application and the case diary.\n7.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 2577,
      "end": 2687,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.23584504425525665
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 24,
      "text": "According to the material on the case diary, the victim aged around 23 years orally reported to the Police Station Agar Malwa that her father Dinesh (applicant) had sexually exploited her since the year 2018.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 2688,
      "end": 2896,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Police Station Agar Malwa",
          "label": "ORG",
          "start": 2788,
          "end": 2813
        },
        {
          "text": "Dinesh",
          "label": "PETITIONER",
          "start": 2830,
          "end": 2836
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2011972963809967
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 25,
      "text": "In November 2021, the applicant committed penetrative sexual assault with the victim.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 2897,
      "end": 2982,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.21666011214256287
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 26,
      "text": "The family did not support her.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 2983,
      "end": 3015,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.20620061457157135
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 27,
      "text": "She shared her plight with friends.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 3016,
      "end": 3051,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.22322939336299896
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 28,
      "text": "Her friend Shrinidhi assisted the victim to install a hidden video camera at her room.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 3052,
      "end": 3138,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Shrinidhi",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 3063,
          "end": 3072
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.22733399271965027
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 29,
      "text": "She was distressed due to repeated threats and ill treatment of Dinesh, therefore came to report.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 3139,
      "end": 3236,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Dinesh",
          "label": "PETITIONER",
          "start": 3203,
          "end": 3209
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.23420582711696625
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 30,
      "text": "The video footage of alleged misdeed were submitted to the Police.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 3237,
      "end": 3303,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2436758130788803
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 31,
